$MDESC::Type = "Defend and Destroy";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Defend & Destroy" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Ultima Thule" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> tribes are battling for survival on the remote planet of Ultima Thule.  The Diamond Sword, owners of the planet, have started Paytonium drilling on their new platform and the Blood Eagle want to shut it down and steal the technology.  The hovering Fortress of the Blood Eagle approaches the platform and they attack.  Their objective is to knock out the Platforms generators to stop all drilling of Paytonuim.  The Diamond Sword must take out the Fortresses generators to shut down the jets holding up the massive Fortress and send it plummeting to the valley below!   Map By: [HvC]Leviathan";
